  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Financial inclusion in Tunisia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Finanzielle Inklusion in Tunesien</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Einkommensschwache, &#xf6;konomisch aktive Menschen, vorwiegend in l&#xe4;ndlichen und peri-urbanen R&#xe4;umen und insbesondere Frauen, nutzen vermehrt formelle Finanzdienstleistungen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-income, economically active people, mainly in rural and peri-urban areas and especially women, are increasingly using formal financial services.</narrative>
  </description>
